<title>INDIA: India DCM sells car stake to Daewoo.</title>
<headline>India DCM sells car stake to Daewoo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's DCM Ltd said on Thursday it had concluded the sale of 24 percent of car-maker DCM Daewoo Motors Ltd. at 23.50 rupees for each 10-rupee share to South Korea's Daewoo Corp.</p>
<p>Daewoo already held 51 percent of the company.</p>
</text>
